# machine-local
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.DS_Store
.positai

# quarto build
/.quarto/
_book*/
_site*/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
/*_cache/
/*_files/

# latex / pdf intermediates
*.aux
*.log
*.toc

# NOTE: _freeze/ is deliberately NOT ignored -- committing it lets a
# colleague render the book without installing R and every package.
# NOTE: docs/ is deliberately NOT ignored -- GitHub Pages serves it.

# Dropbox: never commit conflicted copies
*conflicted copy*

# NOTE: the *_cache/ and *_files/ rules above are root-anchored on purpose.
# Quarto renders each chapter in the project root and then moves the output
# into docs/, so the leftovers to ignore are the ROOT ones. An unanchored
# **/*_files/ would also swallow docs/04-writing_files/, which holds the
# figures GitHub Pages serves -- chapter 4's plot would 404.
